Text
  The paragraphs, questions and answers in the results_* folders were written by the three models
  (Qwen3.5-4B, NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt E4B, NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Nano 4B) during the runs.

Not included
  The models, the benchmarks (MMLU, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, PIQA) and the GSM8K and
  SciQ datasets are downloaded at run time from their own sources, under their own licenses. The
  general text the runs use (paragraphs from English Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0) is not included.
